    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "“Women School of Leadership made me to realize my potential. I never thought I would ever be a supervisor. I thought that the role was for people better than myself. But through training and change of attitude, I can be counted amongst the supervisors in our farm. This makes me proud.”"
